 m
CATEGORIES:Law,Politics
DESCRIPTION:Faculty of Law\nTopics: Law\, Politics\nDetails: https://www.la
 w.cam.ac.uk/events/legal-and-political-theology-colloquium\nSign-up needed
 \nDate/time: \n\n Saturday 23 January 2027 \n\n 10:00am to 5:00pm\n\n Loca
 tion: \n\n Jesus College\n\n Webb Library\n\n This colloquium explores key
  theological concepts that continue to exert deep philosophical influence 
 on legal thought: good and evil\, justice and mercy\, faith and reason.\n\
 n About \n\n Keynote speaker Professor Paul Kahn\, Robert W. Winner Profes
 sor of Law and the Humanities\, Yale University. Arthur Goodhart Visiting 
 Professor in Legal Science\, University of Cambridge.\n With presentations
  by Professor Lars Vinx (Cambridge) Professor Valentin Jeutner (Lund) Dr N
 ick McBride (Cambridge) Dr Giordana Campagna (Cambridge) Dr Anna Lukina (L
 SE) Dr Joshua Neoh (ANU) Registration is free. To register\, please email:
  Francis H.J. Lim - hanjun.lim@anu.edu.au\n Any inquiries may be directed 
 to the convenors: Raffael Fasel - rnf22@cam.ac.uk and Joshua Neoh - joshua
 .neoh@anu.edu.au
